OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAM25 at 40: Keeping UK's busiest
OL,4,Amotorway moving
OL,5,
OL,6,FSometimes referred to as "The Road to
OL,7,FHell" or "Europe's largest car park",
OL,8,Fthe M25 remains an essential part of
OL,9,FBritain's transport network.
OL,11,FSince it officially opened on 29
OL,12,FOctober 1986, many workers over the
OL,13,Fyears have contributed to the
OL,14,Festablishment and maintenance of the
OL,15,FUK's busiest motorway.
OL,17,FChris Nutton, traffic officer for
OL,18,FNational Highways, said: "We have days
OL,19,Fwhen it runs very smoothly and we have
OL,20,Fdays when all hell can break loose."
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
