OL,3,GNEWSAM25 at 40: Keeping UK's busiest
OL,4,Amotorway moving
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis colleague Esther Martin added that
OL,7,Faside from dealing with daily incidents
OL,8,Flike vehicle breakdowns, they have
OL,9,Fencountered some unexpected ones like
OL,10,Fbolting horses.
